Each job gets a score from zero to a hundred, and the best fits are marked as strong matches.","start":4.449748800000066,"end":9.860325799999941},{"text":"Each one has a short reason, and a heads up when something needs a closer look.","start":10.735410399999978,"end":14.644589799999949},{"text":"Click details to see exactly why it fits, and where the gaps are.","start":15.51126929999998,"end":19.11961050000002},{"text":"Open posting takes you to the job on the employer's site.","start":22.75193850000005,"end":26.054472399999895},{"text":"That's where you apply.","start":26.242107900000065,"end":27.328364799999918},{"text":"Then come back and mark it applied, and it moves to your Tracker.","start":28.195285900000044,"end":31.50968839999996},{"text":"Or decline it, or save it for later.","start":31.693567099999996,"end":33.834667800000034},{"text":"Jobs with low scores are hidden.","start":34.704724899999974,"end":36.47848060000001},{"text":"Tick show low scores to see everything the search found.","start":36.66550930000005,"end":39.37468249999995},{"text":"That's it.","start":42.002512300000035,"end":42.7048489},{"text":"You've gone from setup to your first list of jobs.","start":42.890581999999995,"end":45.459081399999945},{"text":"Next, try Searcher Mode, to run your searches automatically.","start":45.64535909999995,"end":49.110976699999924},{"text":"Thanks for watching.","start":49.3001203,"end":50.4233342}]}